---
import "../../styles/global.css";
import Footer from "../../components/Footer.astro";
import Header from "../../components/Header.astro";
---

<html lang="en">
  <head><!-- Start cookieyes banner --> <script id="cookieyes" type="text/javascript" src="https://cdn-cookieyes.com/client_data/e9c032e34948c08e8ad6b9973971db36/script.js"></script> <!-- End cookieyes banner -->
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />

    <title>Nordic Crescent Woven Bathroom Basket | KASODI</title>

    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Discover the Nordic Crescent Woven Bathroom Basket, selected by KASODI for its sculptural crescent shape, warm woven texture and versatile bathroom storage."
    />
  </head>

  <body>

    <Header />


    <main class="product-detail-page">

      <div class="product-breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span>·</span>
        <a href="/bathroom">Bathroom</a>
        <span>·</span>
        <span>Nordic Crescent Woven Bathroom Basket</span>
      </div>


      <section class="product-detail-hero">

        <div class="product-detail-image product-detail-image--crescent">
          <img
            src="/images/bathroom/nordic-crescent-woven-bathroom-basket.png"
            alt="Nordic crescent woven bathroom basket styled by KASODI"
          />
        </div>


        <div class="product-detail-content">
    
          <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">
            KASODI EDIT · BATHROOM
          </p>

          <h1>
            Nordic Crescent Woven Bathroom Basket
          </h1>

          <p class="product-detail-brand">
            Temu Find
          </p>

          <p class="product-detail-intro">
            A sculptural woven storage basket with a softly curved crescent
            silhouette and warm rattan-look texture. Compact enough for the
            bathroom counter or open shelf, it brings practical storage and
            decorative character to everyday essentials.
          </p>


          <div class="product-detail-divider"></div>


          <div class="product-detail-meta">

            <div>
              <span>Material</span>
              <strong>Synthetic rattan</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Colour</span>
              <strong>Warm natural</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Shape</span>
              <strong>Crescent · Sculptural</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Style</span>
              <strong>Nordic · Natural</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Placement</span>
              <strong>Countertop · Shelf · Bathside</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Ideal for</span>
              <strong>Towels · Skincare · Bathroom essentials</strong>
            </div>

          </div>


          <div class="affiliate-action">

            <a
              href="https://temu.to/k/eb6ti8kfoue"
              target="_blank"
              rel="nofollow sponsored"
              class="product-shop-button"
            >
              Find It Here →
            </a>

            <p class="affiliate-note">
              Affiliate link · KASODI may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
            </p>

          </div>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="why-we-love">

        <div class="why-we-love-label">
          KASODI NOTE
        </div>

        <div class="why-we-love-content">

          <h2>Why we love it</h2>

          <p>
            This is the kind of storage piece that does not need to be hidden.
            The curved silhouette gives it the character of a decorative object,
            while the woven texture brings warmth to smooth bathroom surfaces
            such as ceramic, glass and stone.
          </p>

          <p>
            We especially like it beside a bath, on an open shelf or on a larger
            vanity where it can hold rolled guest towels, skincare or everyday
            bathroom essentials. The warm rattan-look finish makes it easy to
            combine with cream ceramics, natural wood and soft neutral textiles.
          </p>

          <p>
            It is also a good example of affordable storage that can make a
            bathroom feel more considered without adding visual clutter.
          </p>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="product-care">

        <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">
          CARE
        </p>

        <h2>Keep the weave looking its best</h2>

        <p>
          Dust regularly with a soft dry cloth or a gentle brush to keep the
          woven surface clean. For small marks, wipe carefully with a lightly
          damp cloth and allow the basket to dry fully.
        </p>

        <p>
          Avoid prolonged contact with standing water and keep it in a
          well-ventilated area, especially when used close to a bath or sink.
        </p>

      </section>


      <section class="styling-ideas">

        <div class="styling-heading">
          <p>KASODI STYLING</p>
          <h2>Style it with</h2>
        </div>


        <div class="styling-grid">

          <div class="styling-card">
            <span>01</span>
            <h3>Warm Cream Ceramics</h3>
            <p>
              Pair the woven texture with soft cream ceramic accessories for a
              calm combination of structured and natural surfaces.
            </p>
          </div>


          <div class="styling-card">
            <span>02</span>
            <h3>Rolled Guest Towels</h3>
            <p>
              Small white, ivory or oatmeal towels emphasize the basket's curved
              shape and create a simple spa-inspired arrangement.
            </p>
          </div>


          <div class="styling-card">
            <span>03</span>
            <h3>Natural Wood</h3>
            <p>
              Use it on a bamboo or warm wood shelf to build a softer,
              Mediterranean-inspired bathroom palette.
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="continue-exploring">

        <div class="continue-exploring-heading">
          <p>KASODI EDIT</p>
          <h2>Continue Exploring</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="continue-exploring-grid">


          <a
            href="/bathroom/ava-nord-ceramic-bathroom-set"
            class="continue-card"
          >

            <div class="continue-card-image">
              <img
                src="/images/bathroom/ava-nord-ceramic-bathroom-set-cream.png"
                alt="Ava Nord Ceramic Bathroom Set"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="continue-card-info">
              <span>BATHROOM ACCESSORIES</span>
              <h3>Ava Nord Ceramic Bathroom Set</h3>
              <p>Ava Nord</p>
              <strong>Discover →</strong>
            </div>

          </a>


          <a
            href="/bathroom/harliangxy-glass-gold-cosmetic-organizer"
            class="continue-card"
          >

            <div class="continue-card-image">
              <img
                src="/images/bathroom/harliangxy-glass-gold-cosmetic-organizer.png"
                alt="Glass and Gold Vanity Organizer"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="continue-card-info">
              <span>VANITY ORGANIZATION</span>
              <h3>Glass & Gold Vanity Organizer</h3>
              <p>HARLIANGXY</p>
              <strong>Discover →</strong>
            </div>

          </a>


          <a
            href="/bathroom/oiahomy-large-woven-rope-laundry-basket"
            class="continue-card"
          >

            <div class="continue-card-image">
              <img
                src="/images/bathroom/oiahomy-large-woven-rope-laundry-basket.png"
                alt="Large Woven Rope Laundry Basket"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="continue-card-info">
              <span>LAUNDRY & STORAGE</span>
              <h3>Large Woven Rope Laundry Basket</h3>
              <p>OIAHOMY</p>
              <strong>Discover →</strong>
            </div>

          </a>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="product-final-cta">

        <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">
          KASODI EDIT · WOVEN STORAGE
        </p>

        <h2>
          Storage with a softer, more sculptural side.
        </h2>

        <a
          href="https://temu.to/k/eb6ti8kfoue"
          target="_blank"
          rel="nofollow sponsored"
          class="product-shop-button"
        >
          Find It Here →
        </a>

        <p class="affiliate-note affiliate-note-light">
          Affiliate link · KASODI may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
        </p>

      </section>

    </main>


    <Footer />


    <style>
      .product-detail-image--crescent img {
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        object-fit: contain;
        object-position: center center;
      }
    </style>

  </body>
</html>